The simplest mechanism the source provides for handling this is the scrum of scrums.

75
00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:00.990
It's pretty straightforward.

76
00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:05.950
representatives from each team meet two to three times a week. They report their progress and,

77
